        "status": "investigating",
        "body": "Cloudflare is investigating issues with Workers Cron Triggers. Customers who have recently created or modified a Cron Trigger schedule may find that the schedule is not executing as expected. Pre-existing Cron Trigger schedules that have not been recently modified are not affected. \n\nWe are working to identify the cause and mitigate this problem. More updates to follow shortly.",
